  "releaseNotes": "<!-- Release notes generated using configuration in .github/release.yml at 5e19eae50d970e28eeb8fcc49b1f5fc8ad87d0f0 -->\n\n## What's Changed\n### Other Changes\n* Extract Architecture.Library engine into ArchLinterNet by @eugenemalaschuk-source in https://github.com/eugenemalaschuk-source/arch-linter-net/pull/1\n* Сomplete CLI/test-adapter tooling for strict/audit validation (#658) by @eugenemalaschuk-source in https://github.com/eugenemalaschuk-source/arch-linter-net/pull/2\n* docs: add MkDocs documentation site with Python tooling (#663) by @eugenemalaschuk-source in https://github.com/eugenemalaschuk-source/arch-linter-net/pull/3\n* docs: add AI policy authoring kit by @eugenemalaschuk-source in https://github.com/eugenemalaschuk-source/arch-linter-net/pull/4\n* Add manual NuGet release pipeline by @eugenemalaschuk-source in https://github.com/eugenemalaschuk-source/arch-linter-net/pull/5\n* ci: fix NuGet release workflow by @eugenemalaschuk-source in https://github.com/eugenemalaschuk-source/arch-linter-net/pull/6\n* feat: add external: true flag to suppress empty-layer config diagnostic by @eugenemalaschuk-source in https://github.com/eugenemalaschuk-source/arch-linter-net/pull/8\n* feat: add stable contract IDs and --contract CLI flag for selective execution by @eugenemalaschuk-source in https://github.com/eugenemalaschuk-source/arch-linter-net/pull/20\n* feat: add protected dependency surface contracts by @eugenemalaschuk-source in https://github.com/eugenemalaschuk-source/arch-linter-net/pull/21\n* feat: add container-based layer templates with optional layers by @eugenemalaschuk-source in https://github.com/eugenemalaschuk-source/arch-linter-net/pull/31\n* [TASK][AI] Tooling: Add backlog governance documentation by @eugenemalaschuk-source in https://github.com/eugenemalaschuk-source/arch-linter-net/pull/32\n* ci: add release acceptance gate before package packing by @eugenemalaschuk-source in https://github.com/eugenemalaschuk-source/arch-linter-net/pull/33\n* feat: add automatic version bump selection with release_type dropdown by @eugenemalaschuk-source in https://github.com/eugenemalaschuk-source/arch-linter-net/pull/34\n* feat: add generated release-note categories configuration by @eugenemalaschuk-source in https://github.com/eugenemalaschuk-source/arch-linter-net/pull/35\n* [TASK][AI] Tooling: Add calculated release notes step (#24) by @eugenemalaschuk-source in https://github.com/eugenemalaschuk-source/arch-linter-net/pull/36\n* feat(release): embed release notes in NuGet packages and upload as artifact by @eugenemalaschuk-source in https://github.com/eugenemalaschuk-source/arch-linter-net/pull/37\n* feat(release): create GitHub Release after NuGet publication by @eugenemalaschuk-source in https://github.com/eugenemalaschuk-source/arch-linter-net/pull/38\n\n## New Contributors\n* @eugenemalaschuk-source made their first contribution in https://github.com/eugenemalaschuk-source/arch-linter-net/pull/1\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/eugenemalaschuk-source/arch-linter-net/commits/v0.1.0-preview.4",
